  "question": {
    "text": "The probability that A speaks truth is $\\frac{4}{5}$, while this probability for $B$ is $\\frac{3}{4}$. The probability that they contradict each other when asked to speak on a fact is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "JDJ8S",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{3}{20}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ygjH9",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{1}{5}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "xA5dK",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{7}{20}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Ys8l7",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{4}{5}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{E}_1$ : event denoting that $A$ speaks truth\n$\\mathrm{E}_2$ : event denoting that $B$ speaks truth\nProbability that both contradicts each other $=P\\left(E_1 \\cap \\bar{E}_2\\right)+P\\left(\\bar{E}_1 \\cap E_2\\right)=\\frac{4}{5} \\cdot \\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{5} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{7}{20}$",
    "image": null
  },
